# Local runtime state - audit logs, SQLite state, process logs. Real
# session data that must never enter version control, not because it's
# secret by design (this project's own rule is env var/local file for
# anything sensitive) but because a working audit.log grows unboundedly and
# a stray one has no business in a diff.
*.log
*.db
*.db-journal

# Built binaries. cmd/* are meant to be `go run` or built on demand: no
# reason to track a platform-specific artifact.
*.exe
/scratch_*
/rinwall
/proxy
/mockupstream
/blastradius
/loadtest
/auditverify
/devtoken

# Python scratch state from scripts/*.py and poc/proxy/*.py.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Anything credential-shaped, even though nothing in this repo's history
# should ever legitimately be one - the standing rule all session has been
# env var or a local untracked file, never a committed one.
*.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Editor/OS cruft.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude Code's own local session/tool state - per-machine permission
# grants, session locks, PIDs. Not product code, machine-specific, has no
# business in a shared repo.
.claude/

# Research pipeline outputs: regenerated by scripts/sample_registry.py + blastradius.
# The raw corpus names third-party servers and their catalogs, so it is not published;
# the write-up carries aggregates and the pipeline to reproduce them.
research/servers.txt
research/corpus.json
research/*.log
research/corpus_reclassified.json
research/validation_sample.full.json
research/launch-texts.md
